{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>חברת.</b> Like the form of an adjective, or it may be like the form of a verb — \"this one is joined to this one.\" The witness: חבור עצבים אפרים הנח לו (Hosea 4:17), which is a passive participle."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:29.026116204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}